  "segments": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "start": 0.396,
      "end": 4.369,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "盐这个东西啊，是我们每个人呢每一天都离不开的。",
      "score": 0.0753,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.045,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0423,
        "sc_delta": 0.0027,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.019,
        "seg_cer": 0.143,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "盐这个东西啊，是我们美国人呢，每天都离不开的。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 4.41,
      "end": 9.327,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "人体呢，如果一旦缺了盐，就会造成体内的钠含量过低，",
      "score": 0.0,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0012,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0012,
        "sc_delta": 0.0,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.0,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "人体呢，如果一旦缺了盐，就会造成体内的钠含量过低。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 9.327,
      "end": 12.293,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "就会出现食欲不差、手脚没力，",
      "score": 0.68,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -1.0395,
        "sc_logprob": -1.0604,
        "sc_delta": -0.0209,
        "acoustic_dev": 1.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.417,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "就会出现死鱼比较差，手脚面力。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 12.293,
      "end": 16.504,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "以后呢发生头昏、目眩，严重的时候呢还会打恶心、",
      "score": 0.1686,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.255,
        "sc_logprob": -0.2567,
        "sc_delta": -0.0018,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.324,
        "seg_cer": 0.0,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "以后呢，发生头昏目眩，严重的时候呢，还会打恶心。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 16.504,
      "end": 20.114,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "厌食、心率加速等等。但反过来我们想呢，",
      "score": 0.4736,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.5831,
        "sc_logprob": -0.6671,
        "sc_delta": -0.084,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.801,
        "seg_cer": 0.125,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "眼视心率加速等等，但反过来，我们想呢。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 20.114,
      "end": 27.157,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "如果你把盐吃多了，这个必需品它就会变成一个极具杀伤力的健康杀手。",
      "score": 0.0,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0013,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0018,
        "sc_delta": -0.0005,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.0,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "如果你把盐吃多了，这个必需品，它就会变成一个极具杀伤力的健康杀手。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 27.62,
      "end": 34.066,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "食用盐摄入过量，不但会使血压升高，发生心血管的疾病风险显著的增加，",
      "score": 0.0305,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0007,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0009,
        "sc_delta": -0.0002,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.067,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "食用盐摄入过量，不但会失血啊，升高发生心血管的疾病风险显著的增加。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 34.066,
      "end": 36.358,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "也会增加胃病、骨质疏松、",
